WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.320
Oh,

2
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.400
Mi bisnieto está aquí.

3
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.680
El viejo señor Alston.

4
00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.280
No me llamaste abuelo,

5
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.320
Entonces no me has perdonado.

6
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.720
abuelo,

7
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:17.560
