9
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.440
mi bisnieto.

10
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:20.400
¿Qué ocurre?

11
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.120
¿Eres mi bisabuelo?

12
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.480
Sí.

13
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.880
Soy tu bisabuelo.

14
00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.320
