15
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.600
Ahuyentaste a mi mamá.

16
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.560
Oh.

17
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.800
fui engañado

18
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.400
